SUMMARY:FAME kit 01/10 · X + Facebook · Get paid by link
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 1 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinke
 dIn is taken by First Principles at 15:00.\n\nTOPIC: Get paid by link\n\
 nCARD (open\, then long press to save):\nhttps://raw.githubusercontent.c
 om/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/get-paid-by-link.jpg\n\nX POST\n_
 _____________________________\n\nA freelancer should not have to explain
  a wallet to get paid.\n\nFAME payment requests are one link. You set th
 e amount\, you send it however you already talk to the client\, and they
  pay it.\n\nIf they are not on FAME\, the same link invites them in. Nob
 ody installs anything before agreeing to pay.\n\nTen cents flat\, settle
 d straight to you.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n\n\n
 FACEBOOK POST\n______________________________\n\nGetting paid should not
  be the hard part of the job.\n\nWith FAME you create a payment request\
 , set the amount\, and send the link. Your client opens it and pays. Tha
 t is the whole thing.\n\nThey do not need an account first. If they have
  never heard of FAME\, the same link gets them started\, and the money s
 till comes straight to you.\n\nOur fee is ten cents\, flat\, whatever th
 e invoice.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n
