SUMMARY:FAME kit 02/10 · X + Facebook · Guardians: envelopes and passwo
 rds
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 2 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinke
 dIn is taken by First Principles at 15:00.\n\nTOPIC: Guardians: envelope
 s and passwords\n\nCARD (open\, then long press to save):\nhttps://raw.g
 ithubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/guardians-envel
 opes.jpg\n\nX POST\n______________________________\n\nA guardian is one 
 person with two powers.\n\nA recovery code gets somebody back into their
  account.\n\nAn envelope pre-approves one cash withdrawal. One agent\, o
 ne day\, one limit\, revocable until it is used.\n\nThe guardians page n
 ow leads with whoever is waiting on you right now\, because someone stan
 ding at a counter cannot wait for you to scroll.\n\nalgofame.org\n______
 ________________________\n\n\nFACEBOOK POST\n___________________________
 ___\n\nIf you are somebody's guardian\, there are two things you can han
 d them.\n\nA recovery code\, which gets them back into their account if 
 they are locked out.\n\nAn envelope\, which approves one cash withdrawal
  in advance. One shop\, one day\, one limit. You can cancel it right up 
 until it is used.\n\nWe rebuilt the page so the person actually waiting 
 on you appears first\, above everything else. Someone standing at a coun
 ter should never be at the bottom of a list.\n\nalgofame.org\n__________
 ____________________\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits
 /guardians-envelopes.jpg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT15M
