UID:fame-kit-2026-08-05@algofame.org
DTSTAMP:20260731T150000Z
DTSTART:20260805T150000Z
DTEND:20260805T153000Z
SUMMARY:FAME kit 03/10 · X + Facebook · Cutting off an agent vs ending 
 the tier
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 3 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinke
 dIn is taken by First Principles at 15:00.\n\nTOPIC: Cutting off an agen
 t vs ending the tier\n\nCARD (open\, then long press to save):\nhttps://
 raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/cut-off-vs
 -end.jpg\n\nX POST\n______________________________\n\nTwo ways to leave 
 a counter\, and only one is reversible.\n\nA guardian can cut off a memb
 er's agent alone\, without being asked. The vault carries forward\, so t
 he same four digits work at any other shop tomorrow.\n\nEnding the assis
 ted tier is final\, and only the member can do it\, from their own sessi
 on.\n\nA guardian is the person who can help you. Never the person who c
 an strand you.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n\n\nFACE
 BOOK POST\n______________________________\n\nThere are two different way
 s to walk away from a shop\, and we deliberately gave them to different 
 people.\n\nA guardian can cut off the counter someone is using\, on thei
 r own\, without waiting to be asked. Nothing is lost. The same PIN works
  at any other shop the next day. That is what makes it safe to give a gu
 ardian.\n\nEnding the assisted tier completely is permanent\, and for so
 meone without a smartphone it means losing access to their money until t
 hey get one. So only the member can do that\, and only from their own se
 ssion.\n\nA guardian is the person who can help you\, not the person who
  can strand you.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits
 /cut-off-vs-end.jpg
