DTSTAMP:20260731T150000Z
DTSTART:20260806T150000Z
DTEND:20260806T153000Z
SUMMARY:FAME kit 04/10 · X + Facebook · CI and the reliability week
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 4 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinke
 dIn is taken by First Principles at 15:00.\n\nTOPIC: CI and the reliabil
 ity week\n\nCARD (open\, then long press to save):\nhttps://raw.githubus
 ercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/ci-reliability.jpg\n\n
 X POST\n______________________________\n\nA bug in our money logic once 
 shipped and sat live for a day before a human caught it.\n\nHumans do no
 t run on the next change. Tests do.\n\nEvery push now runs typecheck\, e
 very workspace test including the SQL gates\, and every build. No secret
 s in CI\, so it can never touch real funds. Red does not deploy.\n\nFour
  reliability fixes landed this week on top of it.\n\nalgofame.org\n_____
 _________________________\n\n\nFACEBOOK POST\n__________________________
 ____\n\nSome honesty about how we build this.\n\nLast month a bug in our
  savings-circle logic got through review and stayed live for a day befor
 e somebody spotted it. Nothing was lost\, but that was luck rather than 
 process.\n\nThe fix was not to review harder. A person reviewing careful
 ly today does not protect you from the change somebody makes next month.
  So now every single push runs the full test suite and every build autom
 atically\, and anything failing simply does not go out.\n\nWe also turne
 d that specific bug into a permanent test\, so it can never come back.\n
 \nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits
 /ci-reliability.jpg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT15M
