BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fame-kit-2026-08-07@algofame.org
DTSTAMP:20260731T150000Z
DTSTART:20260807T150000Z
DTEND:20260807T153000Z
SUMMARY:FAME kit 05/10 · X + Facebook · Circles\, organizer direct
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 5 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinke
 dIn is taken by First Principles at 15:00.\n\nTOPIC: Circles\, organizer
  direct\n\nCARD (open\, then long press to save):\nhttps://raw.githubuse
 rcontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/circles-organizer.jpg\n
 \nX POST\n______________________________\n\nMost savings circles need so
 mebody to hold the pot.\n\nThat person is trusted\, and also exposed. If
  they are robbed\, or pressured\, or simply unlucky\, everybody's money 
 is in one place.\n\nFAME circles have no pot. Each contribution goes str
 aight to whoever is owed that round\, settled on chain\, visible to ever
 yone in the circle.\n\nNobody has to be trusted to pass it along.\n\nalg
 ofame.org\n______________________________\n\n\nFACEBOOK POST\n__________
 ____________________\n\nThe oldest way to save together is for everyone 
 to pay into a pot each month\, and one person takes the pot.\n\nIt works
 \, and it has one weak point. Somebody has to hold the money. That perso
 n carries a risk nobody asked them to carry\, and if anything happens to
  them it happens to everyone.\n\nFAME circles remove the pot entirely. W
 hen your turn comes\, everyone pays you directly. The money never sits a
 nywhere in between\, not even with us.\n\nEveryone in the circle can see
  who has paid and what is still owed\, so nobody has to chase anybody.\n
 \nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits
 /circles-organizer.jpg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
