SUMMARY:FAME kit 06/10 · X + Facebook · Hybrid chat encryption
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 6 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinke
 dIn is taken by First Principles at 15:00.\n\nTOPIC: Hybrid chat encrypt
 ion\n\nCARD (open\, then long press to save):\nhttps://raw.githubusercon
 tent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/hybrid-chat-encryption.jpg\
 n\nX POST\n______________________________\n\nFAME chat agrees its keys t
 wo ways at once.\n\nX25519\, the classical scheme with decades of scruti
 ny behind it. And ML-KEM-768\, the post-quantum one NIST selected.\n\nAn
  attacker has to break both. Either alone is a bet on which kind of comp
 uter arrives first\, and we would rather not bet.\n\nKeys are generated 
 on your device and never reach us.\n\nalgofame.org\n____________________
 __________\n\n\nFACEBOOK POST\n______________________________\n\nA short
  note on how your messages in FAME are protected.\n\nEvery conversation 
 key is agreed using two completely different methods at the same time. O
 ne is the standard used across the internet today. The other is a newer 
 one designed to survive quantum computers.\n\nAnyone trying to read your
  messages has to defeat both. Breaking one gets them nothing.\n\nWe do i
 t this way because picking only one would be a guess about which threat 
 shows up first\, and your family's conversations are not something to gu
 ess with.\n\nThe keys are made on your phone and never reach our servers
 .\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits
 /hybrid-chat-encryption.jpg
