BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fame-kit-2026-08-11@algofame.org
DTSTAMP:20260731T150000Z
DTSTART:20260811T150000Z
DTEND:20260811T153000Z
SUMMARY:FAME kit 07/10 · X + Facebook · An account is a person\, not a 
 handset
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 7 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinke
 dIn is taken by First Principles at 15:00.\n\nTOPIC: An account is a per
 son\, not a handset\n\nCARD (open\, then long press to save):\nhttps://r
 aw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/send-to-a-p
 erson.jpg\n\nX POST\n______________________________\n\nAn account is a p
 erson. Not a handset.\n\nSend to the number you already know. A phone nu
 mber if they have one\, a FAME number if they do not\, and the same fiel
 d takes either without being told which.\n\nA mother who owns no phone s
 till has an account you can pay. That was always true in the code. Until
  this week our own words did not say so.\n\nTen cents flat\, whatever th
 e amount.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n\n\nFACEBOOK 
 POST\n______________________________\n\nSending money to family should b
 e as easy as calling them\, and it should not depend on them owning a ph
 one.\n\nIn FAME you send to a person. If they have a phone number\, use 
 it. If they do not own a phone at all\, they have a FAME number instead\
 , and it goes in exactly the same box.\n\nThat has been true in the app 
 since the day it shipped. Our own website was the last place still sayin
 g a phone number was required\, and we fixed that this week.\n\nTen cent
 s\, flat\, no matter how much you send or which border it crosses.\n\nal
 gofame.org\n______________________________\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits
 /send-to-a-person.jpg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
