BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fame-kit-2026-08-12@algofame.org
DTSTAMP:20260731T150000Z
DTSTART:20260812T150000Z
DTEND:20260812T153000Z
SUMMARY:FAME kit 08/10 · X + Facebook · Cancel a stuck cash-out
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 8 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinke
 dIn is taken by First Principles at 15:00.\n\nTOPIC: Cancel a stuck cash
 -out\n\nCARD (open\, then long press to save):\nhttps://raw.githubuserco
 ntent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/cancel-stuck-cashout.jpg\n
 \nX POST\n______________________________\n\nThe honest test of a money a
 pp is what happens when it does not work.\n\nA cash-out at a counter can
  hang. Bad network\, a queue\, a change of mind. You can cancel it\, and
  nothing has moved.\n\nNo transfer\, no fee\, and the guardian's envelop
 e is still intact\, so she can come back that afternoon.\n\nClosing the 
 screen does not leave it hanging either.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________
 ________________\n\n\nFACEBOOK POST\n______________________________\n\nW
 e spend a lot of time on the moments when things go wrong.\n\nPicture so
 meone at a shop counter collecting cash\, and the network drops halfway 
 through. Or the queue is long and she decides to come back later.\n\nTha
 t has to be safe. So a cash-out can be cancelled while it is in progress
 \, and nothing has moved. No money transferred\, no fee taken\, and the 
 approval her son left is still there unused\, so she can walk back in th
 at afternoon and do it properly.\n\nAn app that only works when everythi
 ng goes right is not finished.\n\nalgofame.org\n________________________
 ______\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits
 /cancel-stuck-cashout.jpg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
