BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fame-kit-2026-08-13@algofame.org
DTSTAMP:20260731T150000Z
DTSTART:20260813T150000Z
DTEND:20260813T153000Z
SUMMARY:FAME kit 09/10 · X + Facebook · Ten cents flat\, the remittance
  gap
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 9 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLinke
 dIn is taken by First Principles at 15:00.\n\nTOPIC: Ten cents flat\, th
 e remittance gap\n\nCARD (open\, then long press to save):\nhttps://raw.
 githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/ten-cents-flat
 .jpg\n\nX POST\n______________________________\n\nSending twenty dollars
  home should not cost like sending two thousand.\n\nPercentages punish t
 he smallest transfers hardest\, which is exactly backwards.\n\nFAME char
 ges ten cents. Flat\, whatever the amount\, whatever the border. Network
  fees are ours. There is no shaved exchange rate hiding a second fee.\n\
 nNothing about carrying a number gets harder because the places are far 
 apart.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n\n\nFACEBOOK POS
 T\n______________________________\n\nHere is what it costs to send twent
 y dollars home with FAME.\n\nThey receive twenty dollars. Our fee is ten
  cents. The network fee is zero\, because we pay it.\n\nThat is the whol
 e list. No percentage\, no second fee buried in the exchange rate\, no c
 harge that grows because the money crossed a border.\n\nWe charge a flat
  fee because a percentage takes the most from the people sending the lea
 st\, and that has never made sense to us.\n\nalgofame.org\n_____________
 _________________\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits
 /ten-cents-flat.jpg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT15M
ACTION:DISPLAY
