BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:fame-kit-2026-08-14@algofame.org
DTSTAMP:20260731T150000Z
DTSTART:20260814T150000Z
DTEND:20260814T153000Z
SUMMARY:FAME kit 10/10 · X + Facebook · The community hive
DESCRIPTION:DAILY KIT 10 OF 10\nChannels: FAME X and FAME Facebook.\nLink
 edIn is taken by First Principles at 15:00.\n\nTOPIC: The community hive
 \n\nCARD (open\, then long press to save):\nhttps://raw.githubuserconten
 t.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits/community-hive.jpg\n\nX POST\n
 ______________________________\n\nIn FAME a person is always a hexagon.\
 n\nYour rooms and circles are drawn as one interlocking honeycomb\, and 
 everyone keeps the same colour and initials everywhere they appear.\n\nI
 t is a small thing that does real work. You recognise somebody before yo
 u read their name\, and nobody is ever a stranger twice.\n\nalgofame.org
 \n______________________________\n\n\nFACEBOOK POST\n___________________
 ___________\n\nA small design decision we care about more than we probab
 ly should.\n\nIn FAME\, every person is shown as a hexagon\, and your gr
 oups sit together as a honeycomb. Everyone keeps the same colour and the
  same initials wherever they turn up\, in a circle\, in your contacts\, 
 at a counter.\n\nThe reason is simple. People recognise a shape and a co
 lour faster than they read a name\, and a lot of the people we build for
  are not reading quickly. Getting that right means somebody is never a s
 tranger twice.\n\nalgofame.org\n______________________________\n
URL:https://raw.githubusercontent.com/bilalprof/algofame-assets/main/kits
 /community-hive.jpg
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
STATUS:CONFIRMED
BEGIN:VALARM
